var $author$project$Route$Guide$Troubleshooting$greenLint = '### "The linter is clean but the app won\'t compile"\n\n**Cause:** you\'re treating the linter as the build. It isn\'t. The linter catches the *soft* misses the compiler leaves loose on purpose; it does not replace the compiler. **Symptom:** `elm-review` passes, `elm make` fails. **Fix:** a real `elm make` is the authority — read its error (the earlier entries here are all `elm make` output). **A green linter is not a green build.**';
