var $author$project$Route$Guide$Troubleshooting$kindMismatch = '### A slot won\'t accept your child\n\n**Cause:** you put content of the wrong *kind* in a slot. **Symptom:** a type error naming the slot, with a record field that "doesn\'t match." **Fix:** give the slot the kind it accepts — the compiler usually guesses it for you (*"Maybe chip should be icon?"*).';
